; dijonkitchen.com: the records served by Porkbun's nameservers.
; Only redirects, no site or mail (ADR 2026-10-21-porkbun-registrar-and-dns).
; Porkbun is the source of truth; update this file in the same change as
; any edit made there. SOA and NS records are managed by the DNS host.
$ORIGIN dijonkitchen.com.
$TTL 600

; URL forwarding: 301 to https://www.dijonkitchen.org, path kept, www
; included. Porkbun's forwarding creates these records itself and serves
; the redirect from uixie.porkbun.com; another DNS host would need its own
; redirect service in their place.
; Porkbun also publishes _acme-challenge TXT tokens for the forwarding's
; Let's Encrypt certificates. They change at every renewal, so they're left out.
; Porkbun stores the apex as ALIAS -> uixie.porkbun.com, which isn't a
; standard record type; these are the A records it resolves to.
@       A       207.207.210.23
@       A       207.207.210.36
@       A       207.207.210.50
*       CNAME   uixie.porkbun.com.

; Only Let's Encrypt may issue certificates.
@       CAA     0 issue "letsencrypt.org"

; No mail is sent or received on this domain.
@       MX      0 .
@       TXT     "v=spf1 -all"
_dmarc  TXT     "v=DMARC1; p=reject;"
